    The paper demonstrates this by solving the longstanding problem of constructing a natural Markov process symmetric with respect to the Φ⁴₃ Euclidean quantum field theory measure. The authors conjecture this process describes the Glauert dynamics of 3D ferromagnets near criticality.
    
